## 10. Suma vector cu Threads

### Enunt
Suma elementelor unui vector folosind **thread-uri in mai multe runde**. Vector initial `{9,9,9,9,9,9,9,9}` (8 elem). Runda 1: 4 perechi sumate de 4 threaduri. Runda 2: 2 perechi. Runda 3: 1 pereche. Rezultatul final in `numere[0]`. Se scriu calculele intr-un fisier `calcule.txt`.

### Diagrama
```mermaid
graph TB
    V[Vector 8 elem] --> R1[Runda 1: 4 threads<br/>perechi 0+1, 2+3, 4+5, 6+7]
    R1 --> R2[Runda 2: 2 threads<br/>perechi 0+2, 4+6]
    R2 --> R3[Runda 3: 1 thread<br/>0+4]
    R3 --> Out[numere 0 = suma totala]
```

### Cod (`Program.cs`)
```csharp
using System;
using System.Collections.Generic;
using System.IO;
using System.Threading;

namespace Subiect_10
{
    class Program
    {
        private static Int32[] numere = { 9, 9, 9, 9, 9, 9, 9, 9 };
        private static int n = 8;
        private static List<Thread> thread_list = new List<Thread>();
        private static StreamWriter sw = new StreamWriter("calcule.txt");

        static void Main(string[] args)
        {
            int p = 1;
            while (n != 0)
            {
                n /= 2; p *= 2;
                for (int i = 0; i < n; i++)
                {
                    IndiciSumare isum = new IndiciSumare(p * i, p * i + p / 2);
                    Thread t = new Thread(new ParameterizedThreadStart(sumare));
                    thread_list.Add(t);
                    t.Start(isum);
                }
                foreach (Thread t in thread_list) t.Join();
                thread_list.Clear();
            }
            Console.WriteLine("Rezultat: {0}", numere[0]);
            sw.Close();
            Console.Read();
        }

        private static void sumare(object obj)
        {
            IndiciSumare isum = (IndiciSumare)obj;
            sw.WriteLine("Thread {0}: {1} + {2} = {3}",
                Thread.CurrentThread.ManagedThreadId,
                numere[isum.I], numere[isum.J],
                numere[isum.I] + numere[isum.J]);
            numere[isum.I] = numere[isum.I] + numere[isum.J];
        }

        private class IndiciSumare
        {
            public int I, J;
            public IndiciSumare(int i, int j) { I = i; J = j; }
        }
    }
}
