## 19. Suport limba

### Enunt
Aplicatie WinForms cu un `Label`. Un `Timer` la 3 secunde schimba ciclic limba: **EN -> RU -> DE** folosind `ResourceManager` + `CultureInfo` + fisiere `.resx` (`lang_en`, `lang_ru`, `lang_gr`).

### Diagrama
```mermaid
graph LR
    Timer[Timer 3s] -->|i%3| Lang{i mod 3}
    Lang -->|0| EN[en-US lang_en.resx]
    Lang -->|1| DE[de-DE lang_gr.resx]
    Lang -->|2| RU[ru-RU lang_ru.resx]
    EN & DE & RU --> Label
```

### Cod (`Form1.cs`)
```csharp
using System;
using System.Globalization;
using System.Reflection;
using System.Resources;
using System.Windows.Forms;

namespace pb19
{
    public partial class Form1 : Form
    {
        public static int i = 0;

        public Form1()
        {
            InitializeComponent();
            timer1.Start();
            timer1.Interval = 3000;
        }

        private void timer1_Tick(object sender, EventArgs e)
        {
            CultureInfo c;
            ResourceManager rm;
            Assembly a = Assembly.Load("pb19");

            if (i % 3 == 0)
            {
                c = new CultureInfo("en-US");
                rm = new ResourceManager("pb19.Lang.lang_en", a);
            }
            else if (i % 2 == 1)
            {
                c = new CultureInfo("ru-RU");
                rm = new ResourceManager("pb19.Lang.lang_ru", a);
            }
            else
            {
                c = new CultureInfo("de-DE");
                rm = new ResourceManager("pb19.Lang.lang_gr", a);
            }
            label1.Text = rm.GetString("label1", c);
            i = (i + 1) % 3;
        }
    }
}
```

**Necesar:** in proiect adauga folder `Lang` cu fisierele `.resx`: `lang_en.resx`, `lang_ru.resx`, `lang_gr.resx`, fiecare cu cheia `label1` si valoarea tradusa.

